@startuml
!include ../../_theme.puml
title Enginepack Selection
top to bottom direction

rectangle "Enginepack Ref Intake" as Ref
rectangle "Installed Enginepack Lookup" as Installed
rectangle "core_engine Check" as CoreEngine
rectangle "Matching core_mod Check" as CoreMod
rectangle "Engine Fixture" as Fixture
rectangle "Mismatch Rejection" as Reject

Ref --> Installed : provides target for
Installed --> CoreEngine : exposes executable to
CoreEngine --> CoreMod : requires matched pair with
CoreMod --> Fixture : produces Engine fixture for
CoreEngine --> Reject : reports missing executable to
CoreMod --> Reject : reports missing module to
@enduml
